#==== Store Listing ====

@store_listing

Restyle any website. Point at something on the page and change it, or describe what you want. Your style loads every time you come back.

★ Pick and style: click any element and change its font, colours, spacing and more, without writing code
★ Code editor: write any CSS by hand
★ Gallery: try styles other people made for a site, and install the one you like
★ Profiles: keep several looks for a site and switch between them
★ Command line: control Stylebot from your terminal, or let a coding agent restyle sites with your own subscription
★ Sync: keep your styles in sync across computers
★ Version history: every change is kept, so you can restore any earlier version
★ Readability: turn articles into a clean, distraction-free reading view

Free and open source. We don't track what you browse.

Homepage: https://stylebot.dev/
Privacy: https://stylebot.dev/privacy
Bug reports and feature requests: https://github.com/ankit/stylebot/issues

